{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_082_1000_049mom", "source_sha256": "2c48d9c5668034f439b6f782a00503ba293ee44f3af039d4bc3582022e3e768f", "ja": "ねえ、志保さん。志保さんが\nこの前もらった曲って、\nバラードだったよね。いいなぁ。", "zh": "志保姐姐，志保姐姐之前收到的那首歌，是抒情曲吧。真好啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_chat_082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_chat_082_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a3f457c9c961af407f2700b67f10e279d3fdfa4fe1a4f3c5b1b868dbf9b7ad89", "ja": "桃子ちゃん、\nバラードが歌ってみたいの？", "zh": "桃子，你想试着唱抒情歌吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
